    <description>This package is deprecated as of Studio 23.10. 
Integration Service Connectors can now be used directly from the Project's Activities panel or Package Manager under All Connectors.

THIS VERSION REQUIRES THE AUTOMATION CLOUD INTEGRATION SERVICE AND STUDIO VERSION 22.10 OR HIGHER. A connector for the Microsoft Azure OpenAI API that allows users to make requests and get completions using Large Language Models (LLM) and other supported models.</description>
